//  9 flags: Rwanda (itunda's own home market) + Kenya/Uganda/Tanzania/
//  Burundi/DR Congo (EAC neighbors) + United States/United Kingdom/European
//  Union (itunda's 3 real supported foreign-currency-account currencies).
//

